WEBVTT

01:42.800 --> 01:43.600
Hello, Mr. Sun.

01:43.800 --> 01:44.600
Happy New Year.

01:45.039 --> 01:45.560
Ye.

01:46.000 --> 01:46.759
Happy New Year.

01:47.680 --> 01:48.280
I need to...

01:48.280 --> 01:48.920
Hold on a sec.

01:50.280 --> 01:50.759
Okay.

01:51.280 --> 01:52.320
Number 101, please come

01:52.320 --> 01:53.400
to Window 3 for your medicine.

01:53.720 --> 01:54.440
That's me.

01:54.520 --> 01:55.160
Thanks a lot.

01:55.520 --> 01:56.360
Go ahead, Ye.

01:57.680 --> 01:58.960
Wait, Mr. Sun, are you okay?

01:59.200 --> 02:00.440
Why are you at the hospital?

02:01.200 --> 02:01.800
I'm fine.

02:02.520 --> 02:04.240
My mother-in-law just had surgery.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.280
I'm picking up her medicine.

02:05.880 --> 02:07.000
Good news for you, Ye.

02:07.320 --> 02:09.039
There's progress on your dad's case.

02:09.600 --> 02:11.280
But I can't go into details right now.

02:11.880 --> 02:13.840
Right, what did you need?

02:14.960 --> 02:15.960
No, nothing.

02:16.400 --> 02:17.520
Just wanted to say hi.

02:19.440 --> 02:20.640
I'll let you get back to it.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.600
Let's catch up another day.

02:31.960 --> 02:33.760
Don't worry about the money,

02:34.560 --> 02:35.360
I've got it covered.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.520
Ye, come here.

02:46.120 --> 02:46.720
Coming.

02:58.880 --> 02:59.520
Auntie.

02:59.640 --> 03:00.160
What's up?

03:06.720 --> 03:07.560
I went over to Xuan Island

03:07.560 --> 03:08.560
to pack up my stuff.

03:09.000 --> 03:10.200
And I found these.

03:10.520 --> 03:11.320
They work perfectly fine.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.840
I'm gonna do pop-up haircuts.

03:14.160 --> 03:15.000
Only five yuan a cut.

03:15.920 --> 03:16.760
Pop-up haircuts?

03:18.440 --> 03:20.720
I'll set up at parks, docks, anywhere.

03:20.840 --> 03:21.680
Cut hair for passersby.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.800
Quick and cheap for everyone.

03:24.079 --> 03:25.240
I should save up a good chunk

03:25.240 --> 03:26.200
for living expenses.

03:26.960 --> 03:27.640
Auntie, you've got

03:27.880 --> 03:29.240
such a sharp business mind.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.040
Seriously.

03:34.320 --> 03:35.520
Haircuts are a constant need.

03:35.720 --> 03:36.760
Going directly to the customers,

03:37.120 --> 03:38.200
might bring in even more business.

03:39.720 --> 03:40.520
Then I'll come help.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.640
You stay home and focus on studying.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.880
But I really wanna help out.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.680
Grandma needs you to keep her company.

03:50.079 --> 03:51.200
Staying with her is your way of helping.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.600
Alright, it's settled then.

03:54.640 --> 03:56.079
Here's to smooth sailing!

03:56.440 --> 03:56.960
Come on!

04:03.320 --> 04:04.840
Earn big money!

04:12.400 --> 04:14.000
Can I come in, Ye?

04:14.400 --> 04:15.040
Auntie.

04:15.640 --> 04:16.440
Still up?

04:17.560 --> 04:18.200
Well...

04:18.760 --> 04:20.200
I was wondering if you could

04:20.200 --> 04:21.000
do me a little favor.

04:22.160 --> 04:22.680
Sit down.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.440
Sure, what is it?

04:25.200 --> 04:26.760
I'm setting up my stall tomorrow.

04:27.240 --> 04:29.000
I wanted to make a sign,

04:29.680 --> 04:31.000
but my handwriting's terrible.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.240
I've messed it up several times.

04:32.640 --> 04:33.400
Your calligraphy's beautiful.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.640
Could you write one for me?

04:35.520 --> 04:36.120
Yeah, sure.

04:42.120 --> 04:42.800
Like this.

05:03.960 --> 05:04.960
How's this, Auntie?

05:05.960 --> 05:07.840
Perfect, Ye.

05:08.200 --> 05:09.280
You whipped it up

05:09.280 --> 05:10.320
in no time.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.040
It looks like it came

05:12.040 --> 05:13.320
from a print shop.

05:13.440 --> 05:14.520
Come on, it's not that good.

05:14.520 --> 05:16.200
It's only a few characters.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.680
But they look absolutely lovely.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.080
Right, Auntie.

05:20.560 --> 05:22.040
Working the stall will be freezing hard.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.200
Take my gloves and hat.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.800
It's freezing out,

05:28.560 --> 05:29.320
you've got to wear them

05:29.680 --> 05:31.120
while working,

05:31.200 --> 05:31.920
or you'll

05:31.960 --> 05:32.800
catch a chill.

05:32.920 --> 05:34.120
This hat's the one we bought

05:34.400 --> 05:35.640
at the market.

05:36.400 --> 05:37.720
It covers your ears.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.360
You're so thoughtful, Ye.

05:40.080 --> 05:41.000
But you know what,

05:41.360 --> 05:42.360
the second

05:42.840 --> 05:43.440
I think about

05:43.880 --> 05:44.680
earning money,

05:45.159 --> 05:46.840
my blood's pumping full of energy.

05:47.120 --> 05:47.840
I don't feel cold at all.

05:49.520 --> 05:49.960
Look at

05:50.440 --> 05:51.159
this character "cut",

05:51.159 --> 05:52.440
isn't it fascinating?

05:53.200 --> 05:54.920
The top half means "before",

05:55.159 --> 05:56.520
and the bottom half is "blade".

05:56.880 --> 05:58.320
So doesn't that mean,

05:59.080 --> 06:00.840
we struggle through hardships

06:00.880 --> 06:03.080
in the first half of life,

06:03.320 --> 06:05.240
and get to live happily in the second half?

06:05.680 --> 06:06.920
Is that how Chinese characters work?

06:08.200 --> 06:09.240
I think

06:10.080 --> 06:11.160
you're absolutely right.

06:11.960 --> 06:13.880
We're bound to live well later on.

06:14.360 --> 06:15.160
Exactly.

06:15.600 --> 06:16.520
There's no way

06:16.520 --> 06:17.880
I'll stay this unlucky for good.

06:18.440 --> 06:20.160
There's a saying… What is it?

06:21.400 --> 06:23.440
When misfortune hits rock bottom...

06:23.880 --> 06:24.440
And...

06:24.520 --> 06:25.440
Fortune follows.

06:26.400 --> 06:28.080
That's the one.

06:28.680 --> 06:29.800
Money's on its way.

06:29.960 --> 06:30.360
Money's coming.

06:31.920 --> 06:32.440
Ye.

06:33.400 --> 06:34.360
I didn't take good care of you before.

06:34.520 --> 06:35.520
But I'm gonna work

06:36.280 --> 06:38.280
twice as hard from now on,

06:38.720 --> 06:40.360
feed you up nice and healthy.

06:40.760 --> 06:41.560
Auntie,

06:42.520 --> 06:43.520
I'm already living

06:43.520 --> 06:44.760
such a wonderful life.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.280
As long as our whole family

06:47.280 --> 06:48.320
stays together,

06:49.120 --> 06:49.880
that's all the happiness I need.

06:55.080 --> 06:56.440
My sweet, sweet Ye.

07:20.800 --> 07:21.800
Alright, put your pens down.

07:22.280 --> 07:23.000
Time's up.

07:24.040 --> 07:24.680
I'm going to

07:24.680 --> 07:25.800
post the answers in the group chat.

07:25.800 --> 07:26.720
Check your answers.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.320
Then send over

07:28.520 --> 07:29.280
all the questions you got wrong.

07:29.280 --> 07:30.400
We'll go through them this afternoon.

07:30.960 --> 07:32.240
Math first,

07:32.320 --> 07:33.360
then Physics, Chemistry and Biology.

07:33.520 --> 07:34.159
In that order.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.440
Why are you all sending me red envelopes?

07:46.000 --> 07:47.600
I aced my finals last semester.

07:47.760 --> 07:48.440
My dad gave me

07:48.440 --> 07:49.440
a huge New Year envelope.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.159
It's all thanks to you.

07:51.520 --> 07:53.120
You deserve a share of this money.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.600
I'm at my grandparents' place.

07:55.880 --> 07:57.920
Got nowhere to spend my New Year's money,

07:58.600 --> 07:59.520
so I thought I'd spend it on tutoring.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.600
Well, that isn't supposed

08:01.600 --> 08:02.200
to be my tutoring fee.

08:02.400 --> 08:03.840
You're younger than me.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.120
So I owe you red envelopes.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.120
Just take it.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.240
Qing Ye,

08:08.360 --> 08:09.520
if someone gives you a red envelope,

08:09.520 --> 08:10.240
you have to accept it.

08:10.560 --> 08:11.200
If you turn it down,

08:11.200 --> 08:12.720
you're turning good fortune away.

08:13.400 --> 08:14.160
I get it.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.360
You all just want to help me out.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.880
Your reasons

08:24.120 --> 08:25.600
are really touching.

08:26.400 --> 08:27.960
I honestly can't bring myself to refuse.

08:28.720 --> 08:29.920
Alright then, I won't stand on ceremony.

08:30.960 --> 08:32.000
Thank you all for your kindness.

08:34.679 --> 08:35.200
Qing Ye.

08:35.760 --> 08:37.159
What's Wu been up to lately?

08:37.600 --> 08:38.600
I never see him around.

08:39.280 --> 08:41.120
Is he still going to study

08:41.120 --> 08:41.919
with us?

08:42.600 --> 08:44.240
Is he going back to school?

08:44.680 --> 08:45.680
Guys, don't worry,

08:47.400 --> 08:48.840
I'm not letting him slack off.

09:09.600 --> 09:10.520
I sent today's tutoring materials

09:10.520 --> 09:11.960
to your WeChat. You can

09:12.360 --> 09:13.800
go over them in your spare time at work.

09:14.400 --> 09:16.000
Ask me anytime if confused.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.040
Bro Wu,

09:17.280 --> 09:17.920
Happy New Year.

09:18.000 --> 09:18.600
Happy New Year.

09:19.080 --> 09:19.760
You're here early.

09:20.400 --> 09:21.400
Poor proactivity on the job

09:21.520 --> 09:22.440
paired with a negative mental outlook.

09:24.280 --> 09:24.960
Here's your work-start bonus.

09:27.520 --> 09:28.040
No need.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.160
Take it.

09:29.520 --> 09:30.440
My sister told me to give it to you.

09:30.640 --> 09:31.200
Consider it

09:31.280 --> 09:32.200
an early salary payment.

09:33.440 --> 09:34.200
I really can't accept this then.

09:34.520 --> 09:34.840
No one pays wages

09:34.840 --> 09:36.120
before the work gets done.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.120
What's the difference?

09:37.240 --> 09:38.360
We know each other so well.

09:38.520 --> 09:39.000
Take it.

09:39.120 --> 09:39.640
It's different.

09:40.040 --> 09:40.720
What if I take on

09:40.720 --> 09:41.560
too much work this month,

09:41.920 --> 09:43.280
you and Shu Han underpay me?

09:45.520 --> 09:46.520
We'll make it up to you.

09:47.520 --> 09:47.920
How about daily pay?

09:48.520 --> 09:50.720
That way none of us

09:51.520 --> 09:52.520
will feel pressured.

09:55.280 --> 09:55.960
Alright then.

09:56.280 --> 09:57.120
I'll run this

09:57.400 --> 09:58.320
by my sister later.

10:00.520 --> 10:01.120
Wu.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.040
Happy New Year.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.040
Happy New Year.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.280
Can you take a look

10:04.280 --> 10:05.240
at this phone for me?

10:05.960 --> 10:07.320
Another phone to fix?

10:07.760 --> 10:08.840
It's my grandma's.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.360
She's always bugging me

10:10.360 --> 10:11.200
about watching shows on it,

10:11.440 --> 10:12.240
but the screen's flickering nonstop.

10:12.280 --> 10:12.880
Let me see.

10:16.400 --> 10:16.920
Wu.

10:17.360 --> 10:17.800
The sum's small,

10:18.040 --> 10:19.040
but it's from all of us brothers.

10:21.720 --> 10:22.200
Hey, am I

10:22.960 --> 10:24.120
a lucky cat or something?

10:24.520 --> 10:25.960
I've gotten money from lots of people lately.

10:26.400 --> 10:27.600
We all know

10:27.600 --> 10:28.680
you're short on cash right now,

10:28.760 --> 10:29.920
we just want to lend you a hand.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.160
I can't take your money.

10:33.520 --> 10:34.320
If you really wanna help,

10:34.720 --> 10:35.760
hook me up with more jobs instead.

10:36.280 --> 10:37.640
Preferably ones that pay cash daily.

10:38.000 --> 10:38.880
That's easy to sort out.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.240
I've already spread the word around.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.280
You'll have plenty of work offers.

10:41.520 --> 10:42.400
If all else fails,

10:42.400 --> 10:43.600
come to my shop when you're free

10:43.600 --> 10:44.400
and help me fix motorcycles.

10:44.440 --> 10:45.160
I'm shorthanded.

10:46.200 --> 10:46.640
Sounds good.

10:47.600 --> 10:48.080
Thanks a ton.

10:49.560 --> 10:50.200
Wishing your shop booming business.

10:51.800 --> 10:52.480
Bye, Bro Wu.

10:53.120 --> 10:54.000
I'll get your phone fixed for you.

10:54.080 --> 10:54.520
Okay.

11:02.600 --> 11:04.440
Fret not over bygones

11:05.080 --> 11:06.920
and the forward journey take.

11:08.120 --> 11:10.120
Only a short distance have I gone astray,

11:10.640 --> 11:12.640
and I know today I am right,

11:13.800 --> 11:15.160
if yesterday was a complete mistake.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.640
Insist.

11:19.360 --> 11:20.960
Insist on doing something.

11:24.120 --> 11:25.200
You have a new order.

11:25.200 --> 11:26.200
Please accept it.

11:57.120 --> 11:57.680
Sir.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.680
Is this okay?

12:01.640 --> 12:03.360
Great and neat work.

12:04.040 --> 12:04.720
Thanks.

12:05.160 --> 12:06.120
Hope you can

12:06.200 --> 12:08.000
refer more customers to me.

12:08.000 --> 12:08.600
Sure thing.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.880
I'm here every day.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.360
Just scan the code to pay.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.040
Okay, will do.

12:12.040 --> 12:12.520
Next.

12:13.280 --> 12:13.840
Payment sent.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.600
Okay, thanks.

12:15.040 --> 12:15.520
Have a seat.

12:17.120 --> 12:19.880
Keep the length or cut it shorter?

12:20.040 --> 12:20.720
Just do whatever you think fits.

12:21.120 --> 12:21.760
Got it.

12:27.000 --> 12:27.800
Wait a second.

12:28.920 --> 12:29.720
Sir.

12:32.120 --> 12:32.800
Sir.

12:33.680 --> 12:34.400
Sir.

12:35.960 --> 12:36.760
Wait.

12:37.040 --> 12:37.880
Sir.

12:38.280 --> 12:39.040
Sir.

12:39.640 --> 12:40.760
Wait up, sir.

12:41.520 --> 12:42.080
Sir.

12:42.800 --> 12:43.400
Sir.

12:44.400 --> 12:45.040
Sir.

12:48.440 --> 12:49.320
Who are you?

12:50.760 --> 12:51.360
Sir.

12:51.760 --> 12:52.240
Here.

12:52.680 --> 12:53.520
The payment didn't go through.

12:55.640 --> 12:57.360
I thought it worked.

12:57.600 --> 12:58.760
Must be a bad signal.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.000
- Got it.
- Done.

13:03.640 --> 13:04.720
Be more careful next time.

13:09.680 --> 13:10.400
Mr. Zhu.

13:11.120 --> 13:11.720
Thank you.

13:11.880 --> 13:12.560
Don't mention it.

13:12.760 --> 13:13.400
You busy?

13:13.520 --> 13:13.880
Well...

13:13.880 --> 13:15.040
Let me give you a haircut.

13:15.040 --> 13:15.600
Yeah.

13:15.800 --> 13:16.600
Let's go.

13:30.440 --> 13:31.200
You actually got...

14:06.000 --> 14:06.720
I dozed off.

14:07.640 --> 14:08.840
What were you just saying?

14:13.520 --> 14:14.880
I said, you actually got

14:14.920 --> 14:15.840
this physics problem right.

14:16.320 --> 14:16.880
Let me see.

14:19.880 --> 14:20.560
Is it that hard?

14:33.520 --> 14:35.920
Only Ye Yingjian and I

14:35.920 --> 14:36.520
got it right before.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.600
It needs good spatial imagination.

14:42.960 --> 14:44.160
I don't rely on imagination.

14:44.880 --> 14:45.840
I rely on sheer hard work.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.240
I've got work to do later.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.440
So are you coming home tonight?

14:52.000 --> 14:53.680
You haven't been home for almost a week.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.520
Ye Yingjian's uncle

14:55.520 --> 14:56.720
opened an electronics factory.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.560
It opens after the Lantern Festival.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.040
They need surveillance cameras installed

15:00.440 --> 15:00.960
in advance.

15:01.600 --> 15:02.880
And the dashboard on Kyle's uncle's

15:03.120 --> 15:03.960
boat broke again.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.520
Basically, I take every job I can get

15:05.800 --> 15:07.280
to earn every penny I can.

15:49.360 --> 15:50.520
You're out in the cold

15:50.520 --> 15:51.720
cutting hair, and he still

15:51.720 --> 15:52.960
cheats you out of five yuan.

15:53.760 --> 15:54.320
Shame on him.

15:55.080 --> 15:56.240
It's just business.

15:56.840 --> 15:57.960
I've seen plenty like him.

15:58.080 --> 15:58.640
Used to it.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.000
That doesn't make it right.

16:00.160 --> 16:01.320
Lu Xun once said,

16:01.560 --> 16:03.600
old ways don't equal right ways.

16:06.160 --> 16:06.840
Mr. Zhu,

16:07.960 --> 16:09.520
I don't fully get

16:09.920 --> 16:11.720
what you mean by that,

16:12.160 --> 16:14.000
but I know you're absolutely right.

16:14.200 --> 16:14.760
Such a great line.

16:16.000 --> 16:16.600
I really

16:17.120 --> 16:18.400
need to thank you properly.

16:18.520 --> 16:19.360
For what?

16:19.520 --> 16:21.120
Last time,

16:21.280 --> 16:22.200
you went with me

16:22.280 --> 16:23.800
to beg your ex-wife.

16:24.400 --> 16:26.200
And this time, you helped me get back

16:27.000 --> 16:27.960
that five yuan.

16:28.120 --> 16:28.600
Don't mention it.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.360
I really

16:29.360 --> 16:30.160
owe you one.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.840
Forget about last time.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.560
This time, it was the right thing to do.

16:33.600 --> 16:34.040
Look,

16:34.200 --> 16:35.760
you earned that money

16:35.760 --> 16:36.880
with your own hands.

16:37.400 --> 16:38.520
Every penny counts,

16:38.520 --> 16:39.000
right?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.680
I love talking to

16:40.680 --> 16:42.400
educated people like you.

16:42.440 --> 16:43.120
Your words always

16:43.120 --> 16:44.800
put my mind at ease.

16:45.640 --> 16:46.880
Ye is

16:46.880 --> 16:47.760
just like you.

16:48.080 --> 16:49.560
A few simple words from her

16:49.720 --> 16:50.720
always cheer me up.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.000
Studying really pays off.

16:52.160 --> 16:52.800
It's like

16:52.880 --> 16:54.320
a sudden burst of clarity.

16:54.920 --> 16:55.360
Right?

16:55.520 --> 16:56.560
Exactly, total clarity.

16:57.840 --> 16:58.520
By the way, Lanfang.

16:59.320 --> 17:00.520
Where are Xing Wu and Qing Ye?

17:02.440 --> 17:03.240
Turn your head forward.

17:04.359 --> 17:05.720
Stay still while I cut your hair.

17:05.720 --> 17:06.640
I might mess it up otherwise.

17:07.920 --> 17:09.160
What I mean is,

17:10.079 --> 17:10.839
for kids like

17:11.200 --> 17:12.520
Xing Wu and Qing Ye,

17:12.520 --> 17:13.319
they can apply for

17:13.520 --> 17:14.599
student aid

17:14.640 --> 17:15.720
after the new semester starts.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.079
The government has

17:17.079 --> 17:18.680
special support policies for students

17:18.680 --> 17:19.760
from needy families nowadays.

17:20.800 --> 17:21.680
Don't let them

17:21.920 --> 17:23.359
drop out like before,

17:23.359 --> 17:24.599
okay?

17:28.040 --> 17:29.240
You came today

17:33.240 --> 17:34.120
to stop me from

17:34.120 --> 17:35.280
pulling Wu

17:35.280 --> 17:36.080
out of school?

17:36.560 --> 17:37.160
Not really.

17:37.640 --> 17:38.760
I just

17:39.080 --> 17:39.800
dropped by

17:39.800 --> 17:41.000
to get a haircut.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.000
Don't worry.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.120
It won't happen again.

17:45.120 --> 17:45.800
Even if

17:45.800 --> 17:47.200
Wu refuses to go himself,

17:47.280 --> 17:48.720
I'll drag him

17:48.720 --> 17:49.680
to class

17:50.040 --> 17:50.760
and exams.

17:51.200 --> 17:51.960
You can rest assured.

17:52.840 --> 17:53.400
Lanfang,

17:53.840 --> 17:54.600
you've changed.

17:56.080 --> 17:57.080
Changed?

18:00.520 --> 18:01.520
Got older looking?

18:02.240 --> 18:03.120
No, your

18:03.320 --> 18:04.520
perspective's grown wider.

18:08.320 --> 18:08.720
Okay.

18:09.240 --> 18:09.600
All done.

18:10.360 --> 18:11.320
Looking much sharper now.

18:12.520 --> 18:13.400
No need to pay.

18:13.640 --> 18:15.200
Use your discount coupon.

18:15.280 --> 18:17.000
I lost the coupon ages ago.

18:17.320 --> 18:18.440
I'll honor it anyway.

18:18.800 --> 18:19.760
Payment sent.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.400
Fifty yuan received.

18:21.520 --> 18:22.960
Mr. Zhu, that's too much.

18:23.720 --> 18:24.280
Save the extra for next time.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.320
Bye, Lanfang.

18:25.640 --> 18:26.280
Thanks!

18:27.960 --> 18:29.640
Nine more free cuts left for you.

18:39.080 --> 18:42.120
Dinner's ready!

18:46.520 --> 18:47.880
Smells so good, Auntie.

18:48.200 --> 18:49.160
What did you make?

18:50.680 --> 18:51.760
Ye, you're back.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.160
Just in time.

18:53.520 --> 18:54.200
Come up and eat.

18:55.160 --> 18:55.680
Come on.

18:58.200 --> 18:58.720
Come on.

18:59.080 --> 18:59.560
Grandma.

19:00.360 --> 19:01.520
Ye, you're back.

19:01.840 --> 19:03.080
Come. Time to eat.

19:04.640 --> 19:05.840
Did you have a busy day,

19:05.840 --> 19:07.280
Auntie?

19:09.400 --> 19:10.040
Thirty yuan?

19:10.760 --> 19:12.080
Thirty haircuts.

19:12.200 --> 19:12.840
Impressive, right?

19:13.080 --> 19:14.400
Pretty impressive.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.880
No wonder you made pork trotter soup.

19:16.240 --> 19:16.800
Let me see.

19:18.640 --> 19:19.720
So good.

19:19.760 --> 19:21.240
Auntie's raking it in.

19:22.080 --> 19:23.640
Your Grandma gave me the money.

19:23.840 --> 19:25.200
Said I should feed you well.

19:25.400 --> 19:27.200
Have some first, Ye.

19:27.520 --> 19:28.160
Oh, Grandma.

19:28.400 --> 19:28.960
You go first.

19:29.160 --> 19:29.800
You first.

19:30.520 --> 19:31.320
Here's a big trotter for you.

19:31.360 --> 19:32.240
Okay, okay.

19:32.400 --> 19:32.720
Here.

19:32.760 --> 19:33.320
Thanks.

19:34.880 --> 19:35.600
Lanfang,

19:35.760 --> 19:36.560
listen to me.

19:37.040 --> 19:37.760
Money's meant to be

19:38.080 --> 19:38.920
spent on food.

19:39.160 --> 19:39.640
Right.

19:39.880 --> 19:41.920
Never skimp on the kids' meals.

19:42.080 --> 19:42.520
Right.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.840
Shame Wu can't

19:45.320 --> 19:46.240
join us today.

19:48.160 --> 19:48.880
It's okay, Grandma.

19:49.800 --> 19:50.600
I'll bring some to him.

19:52.520 --> 19:52.960
Good.

19:53.320 --> 19:53.760
Here.

20:06.920 --> 20:07.440
Wu.

20:07.600 --> 20:08.400
Someone's here for you.

20:08.760 --> 20:09.160
Coming.

20:12.120 --> 20:12.800
Why are you here?

20:13.520 --> 20:14.960
Auntie had a good day of business,

20:14.960 --> 20:15.800
she made pork trotter soup.

20:15.960 --> 20:16.800
I was afraid you'd miss out,

20:17.040 --> 20:18.080
so I rushed it over.

20:20.920 --> 20:21.640
Still piping hot.

20:22.600 --> 20:24.080
Auntie knows you're hauling cargo,

20:24.440 --> 20:25.560
worried your hands would crack,

20:25.800 --> 20:26.720
so she bought hand cream for you.

20:29.280 --> 20:30.520
Grandma knitted you a pair of gloves,

20:30.960 --> 20:32.520
afraid you'd freeze.

20:35.400 --> 20:35.920
Here.

20:38.160 --> 20:38.640
What about you?

20:39.640 --> 20:40.040
Did you

20:40.040 --> 20:40.840
bring me something too?

20:42.000 --> 20:43.520
I sure did get you a gift.

20:43.960 --> 20:45.080
And my gift

20:45.240 --> 20:47.080
will definitely

20:47.160 --> 20:48.240
sharpen your mind.

20:48.760 --> 20:49.960
It's not what I think it is, is it?

20:52.040 --> 20:53.120
It's exactly what you think it is.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.160
Look.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.360
My handwritten workbook.

20:58.040 --> 20:58.680
What're you laughing at?

20:58.720 --> 21:00.360
It's packed with core exam questions,

21:00.360 --> 21:01.320
all the essential highlights.

21:01.680 --> 21:02.240
I hope you

21:02.240 --> 21:03.440
go through it

21:03.640 --> 21:04.680
in your spare time

21:04.680 --> 21:05.320
and relax a bit.

21:07.520 --> 21:08.520
Since you came all this way

21:08.560 --> 21:09.120
and brought

21:09.120 --> 21:10.000
such a precious gift,

21:10.400 --> 21:11.440
I'll treat you somewhere nice.

21:12.080 --> 21:12.600
Where to?

21:13.640 --> 21:15.520
An all-you-can-eat deluxe buffet.

21:16.280 --> 21:17.760
We already have trotter soup here.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.040
Extra feast for you.

21:20.320 --> 21:21.520
Times are tight,

21:21.840 --> 21:23.040
buffets cost a fortune.

21:23.280 --> 21:23.920
Besides, are any still open

21:23.920 --> 21:24.520
at this hour?

21:24.560 --> 21:24.960
Just come along,

21:25.320 --> 21:26.160
you'll see.

21:28.560 --> 21:28.960
Let's go.

21:37.200 --> 21:37.600
Here we are.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.800
This is your fancy buffet?

21:42.280 --> 21:43.040
Ten yuan per person.

21:43.520 --> 21:44.840
Wide food selection.

21:45.200 --> 21:46.880
Only ten yuan for unlimited food?

21:47.440 --> 21:48.440
All of these?

21:49.680 --> 21:50.440
Really?

21:50.920 --> 21:51.640
What do they have today?

21:51.640 --> 21:53.160
Fried fish, sweet and sour pork.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.200
Spicy tofu.

21:54.480 --> 21:55.440
What are we waiting for?

21:55.520 --> 21:56.520
Let's dig in.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.000
I'm starving.

21:59.880 --> 22:00.720
So hungry.

22:00.760 --> 22:01.760
I just took a whiff.

22:02.040 --> 22:03.880
The fried fish smells amazing.

22:04.240 --> 22:04.680
Here.

22:09.840 --> 22:10.680
Delicious.

22:11.120 --> 22:12.440
Even the bones are crispy-fried.

22:15.200 --> 22:16.000
This one's great too.

22:17.240 --> 22:17.640
Oh right,

22:17.840 --> 22:19.040
don't forget the trotter soup

22:19.040 --> 22:19.680
Auntie packed for you.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.000
Have a bowl yourself.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.600
No need, I already had some.

22:24.000 --> 22:24.680
Just afraid you might choke.

22:36.960 --> 22:37.520
Xing Wu.

22:38.640 --> 22:39.160
Mr. Zhang.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.400
Your girlfriend?

22:41.680 --> 22:42.400
My cousin.

22:43.520 --> 22:44.520
Your cousin's gorgeous.

22:44.560 --> 22:45.800
You're lucky, dude.

22:46.120 --> 22:46.880
Enjoy your meal.

22:47.400 --> 22:47.920
Bye.

22:52.240 --> 22:53.120
Coworker from this morning.

22:58.960 --> 22:59.560
Slow down. Don't choke.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.160
I won't.

23:01.840 --> 23:02.760
I'm not a kid.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.400
You know what?

23:12.640 --> 23:14.120
I've got

23:15.280 --> 23:17.120
a brand-new life lesson today.

23:18.040 --> 23:18.520
What?

23:19.240 --> 23:20.800
The feeling of sudden wealth.

23:21.400 --> 23:23.280
Ten yuan for all that good food.

23:23.560 --> 23:24.680
I'm so stuffed.

23:25.760 --> 23:26.680
Easy, easy, easy.

23:27.240 --> 23:28.680
I can barely move an inch full like this.

23:29.000 --> 23:29.920
At your pace,

23:30.280 --> 23:31.520
we'll miss the last bus home.

23:32.000 --> 23:32.720
What do I do then?

23:34.360 --> 23:34.840
I'll carry you.

23:35.240 --> 23:36.240
No way, no, no.

23:36.520 --> 23:37.720
My belly's so full,

23:38.240 --> 23:39.440
any pressure and I'll throw up.

23:40.240 --> 23:40.760
Alright then.

23:43.800 --> 23:44.840
What're you laughing at?

23:46.520 --> 23:47.560
I just remembered

23:47.840 --> 23:48.880
half a year ago,

23:49.640 --> 23:50.640
someone said their weekly

23:51.160 --> 23:52.920
food budget was 1000 yuan,

23:53.320 --> 23:54.120
any leftover refunded or topped up.

23:54.520 --> 23:54.880
Who said that?

23:56.240 --> 23:57.960
Me, it was me.

23:58.000 --> 23:58.600
Happy now?

23:59.080 --> 24:00.920
Honestly, I regret

24:00.960 --> 24:02.320
blowing money recklessly back then.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.000
That thousand yuan

24:04.240 --> 24:05.280
could've bought

24:05.800 --> 24:07.120
a hundred meals here now.

24:08.160 --> 24:08.600
It's okay.

24:09.560 --> 24:10.920
I've made some cash lately,

24:11.840 --> 24:12.440
enough to feed you.

24:13.760 --> 24:14.960
Heading back to work later?

24:16.920 --> 24:18.080
Got repairs to do

24:18.400 --> 24:19.440
at Shunyi.

24:21.000 --> 24:23.360
Delivering goods, hauling ice,

24:23.840 --> 24:24.880
fixing phones...

24:25.520 --> 24:27.360
When will this grind end? School starts

24:27.840 --> 24:29.520
on the 16th of the first lunar month.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.280
After Lantern Festival.

24:35.360 --> 24:35.920
Rest assured,

24:36.880 --> 24:37.680
I'll go back to school.

24:39.600 --> 24:40.280
Promise?

24:42.520 --> 24:43.000
Promise.

24:46.720 --> 24:47.520
Xing Wu,

24:48.720 --> 24:49.640
I feel for you.

25:04.400 --> 25:04.840
Let's go.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.520
We'll miss the bus otherwise.

25:08.400 --> 25:08.880
Alright.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.560
Then I'll try my best to walk faster.

25:27.120 --> 25:28.160
Why are you washing your hair here?

25:30.600 --> 25:33.000
Hot water ran out halfway.

25:33.240 --> 25:34.720
So I'm rinsing it off out here.

25:37.080 --> 25:38.520
Don't catch a cold. Go dry it.

27:15.400 --> 27:16.440
Ye, I'm coming in.

27:18.440 --> 27:19.000
Auntie.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.520
School starts the day after tomorrow.

27:24.000 --> 27:25.360
Mr. Zhu brought these uniforms over.

27:25.560 --> 27:26.040
Two sets.

27:26.520 --> 27:27.640
I completely forgot about this.

27:29.520 --> 27:29.920
Fits perfectly.

27:30.320 --> 27:30.680
Good.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.000
Tomorrow's the fifteenth.

27:33.160 --> 27:34.040
What would you like to eat?

27:34.080 --> 27:34.800
I'll cook it for you.

27:35.520 --> 27:36.760
I love everything you make.

27:37.440 --> 27:39.320
Such a sweet talker.

27:40.120 --> 27:40.560
I'll leave you to it.

28:44.800 --> 28:45.360
This is the place.

29:26.640 --> 29:27.440
That's

29:27.520 --> 29:28.720
the whole story.

29:29.720 --> 29:30.800
Everything's sorted out now.

29:32.440 --> 29:33.080
Wonderful news.

29:34.320 --> 29:35.840
Have some nuts.

29:35.880 --> 29:36.800
Thanks.

29:36.840 --> 29:37.760
Help yourself to fruit.

29:37.960 --> 29:38.680
Here.

29:38.760 --> 29:39.520
Thanks.

29:39.680 --> 29:40.520
It's nothing.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.160
Mr. Qing.

29:41.360 --> 29:42.200
Here, have some fruit.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.320
And nuts too.

29:43.720 --> 29:44.240
Delicious.

29:46.920 --> 29:48.000
I heard you've been taking

29:48.720 --> 29:49.800
really good care of Ye.

29:52.560 --> 29:53.640
Since it's the New Year,

29:53.920 --> 29:55.600
I prepared some gifts for you.

29:56.160 --> 29:56.720
Sun Hai.

29:56.840 --> 29:57.520
Hand them out.

29:59.200 --> 30:00.160
We really shouldn't accept these.

30:00.160 --> 30:00.920
Please take them.

30:01.360 --> 30:01.960
No need, honestly.

30:02.080 --> 30:02.720
Take it.

30:02.840 --> 30:03.200
Here.

30:03.200 --> 30:03.680
Really, no need.

30:03.680 --> 30:04.520
Come on, take it.

30:04.520 --> 30:05.240
Just a small gesture.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.000
Thanks.

30:06.040 --> 30:07.720
These are all premium goods.

30:07.840 --> 30:09.720
I rushed over unprepared, just a modest gift.

30:10.040 --> 30:11.640
Hope you don't mind.

30:11.920 --> 30:13.240
Not at all.

30:13.400 --> 30:14.640
How could they?

30:14.760 --> 30:15.760
They're overjoyed.

30:15.840 --> 30:16.520
Right.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.600
You must be worn out

30:18.800 --> 30:19.440
from travelling.

30:19.560 --> 30:20.160
We'll have

30:20.400 --> 30:21.520
a light lunch at noon,

30:21.640 --> 30:22.200
and we'll

30:22.400 --> 30:23.520
cook local specialties

30:23.640 --> 30:25.160
for supper.

30:26.080 --> 30:26.520
Well...

30:27.360 --> 30:27.800
Ye.

30:27.920 --> 30:28.840
We'll let you two catch up.

30:29.560 --> 30:30.800
We'll step out first.

30:31.040 --> 30:31.520
Go.

30:31.880 --> 30:32.560
Oh, go.

30:32.560 --> 30:33.160
Should we take these?

30:33.400 --> 30:34.000
Yeah.

30:34.520 --> 30:35.400
Thank you a lot.

30:45.720 --> 30:46.680
Here, tomatoes.

30:47.040 --> 30:47.520
Yeah.

30:49.960 --> 30:52.040
What cheap glass beads are you wearing?

30:52.800 --> 30:53.160
What?

30:53.640 --> 30:55.400
He's a wealthy boss who's seen everything.

30:55.400 --> 30:56.320
Wearing that bulky thing

30:56.320 --> 30:57.280
must strain your neck.

30:57.880 --> 30:58.600
Put it away.

30:59.520 --> 31:00.080
Now.

31:00.320 --> 31:00.520
What?

31:00.520 --> 31:01.080
Keep a low profile.

31:01.080 --> 31:02.360
Hey, what are you doing?

31:03.520 --> 31:04.120
Stop it.

31:04.120 --> 31:04.960
You stuffed it

31:05.080 --> 31:06.280
right inside my clothes.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.000
Let me leave a small part out.

31:12.000 --> 31:12.640
Okay?

31:12.840 --> 31:14.440
Even though he's from the city,

31:14.600 --> 31:16.280
he's got a similar bearing

31:16.520 --> 31:17.840
to my husband.

31:18.520 --> 31:19.400
Oh, give me a break.

31:19.560 --> 31:20.800
He smells nice and fragrant.

31:20.840 --> 31:21.880
That's cologne.

31:21.920 --> 31:22.840
Would your husband wear that?

31:24.440 --> 31:25.560
With your brother-in-law here,

31:26.000 --> 31:26.960
rebuilding the salon

31:27.240 --> 31:28.360
stands a good chance.

31:29.720 --> 31:30.880
For sure.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.840
Look at that car.

31:32.520 --> 31:33.280
Over a million yuan.

31:33.760 --> 31:35.120
What car costs over a million?

31:35.160 --> 31:36.400
Isn't that just a minivan?

31:36.520 --> 31:38.000
That's called a "nanny car" (luxury MPV).

31:38.280 --> 31:39.520
A car for nannies to ride in?

31:41.360 --> 31:42.040
We're speaking two different languages here.

31:42.520 --> 31:44.520
I don't really care about that.

31:46.320 --> 31:47.280
Anyway, I haven't

31:47.880 --> 31:49.040
taken good care of Ye.

31:49.920 --> 31:51.040
Now her father's here,

31:51.320 --> 31:52.160
he'll probably want to

31:52.160 --> 31:53.640
take her home straight away.

31:55.000 --> 31:56.720
She's his daughter after all.

31:57.120 --> 31:58.560
That's exactly

31:59.080 --> 31:59.840
what he's here for.

32:08.600 --> 32:09.840
Step back a bit.

32:10.280 --> 32:10.880
Shift over here.

32:11.200 --> 32:11.920
Get the car logo in frame.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.080
Don't make it look too forced.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.760
Do I look like the owner of this ride?

32:15.960 --> 32:16.400
Like I've put

32:16.400 --> 32:17.560
30,000 kilometers on it?

32:17.840 --> 32:19.120
Move over a little.

32:19.920 --> 32:20.920
You're blocking the logo.

32:29.280 --> 32:29.760
Hello, sir.

32:29.840 --> 32:30.360
Hello, sir.

32:34.840 --> 32:35.880
He ignored me.

32:36.680 --> 32:37.160
Ye.

32:37.640 --> 32:39.040
Your dad's car is really cool.

32:40.320 --> 32:40.920
It's alright.

32:41.640 --> 32:43.720
Hope we get a chance

32:43.720 --> 32:44.520
to ride in it sometime.

32:47.120 --> 32:47.600
Ye,

32:48.280 --> 32:48.760
get in.

32:51.360 --> 32:51.800
Go on.

32:51.800 --> 32:52.360
I'm off.

32:52.360 --> 32:52.720
Okay.

32:52.960 --> 32:53.720
Bye. Bye.

32:58.160 --> 32:58.840
Bye, sir.

32:59.120 --> 32:59.720
Bye, sir.

33:02.640 --> 33:03.120
I can't see her.

33:07.520 --> 33:08.120
That scared me,

33:08.200 --> 33:08.880
they drove off so fast.

33:20.760 --> 33:22.360
Didn't expect that in such a short time,

33:23.360 --> 33:24.960
you've adapted to life here.

33:30.640 --> 33:31.120
Folks here

33:31.120 --> 33:32.440
are nothing like city people.

33:33.440 --> 33:34.720
They're kind-hearted,

33:35.800 --> 33:36.560
genuine and pure.

33:37.360 --> 33:39.000
Spend more time with them and you'll see

33:40.160 --> 33:40.680
these qualities

33:40.680 --> 33:41.840
are incredibly precious.

33:47.120 --> 33:48.520
Back then, sending you here

33:48.760 --> 33:49.600
was my only option.

33:50.840 --> 33:52.080
Now all troubles are sorted out.

33:53.080 --> 33:54.400
I've settled things with your school.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.520
You can leave anytime.

33:56.520 --> 33:57.680
Didn't you always want to study abroad?

33:58.720 --> 34:00.160
What if I don't wanna leave now?

34:01.320 --> 34:02.560
Don’t worry about tuition fees.

34:03.520 --> 34:04.400
It's not about money.

34:06.120 --> 34:07.200
I heard from Sun Hai that you

34:07.840 --> 34:09.080
really wanted to leave Zhazhating.

34:13.159 --> 34:14.320
That was in the past.

34:17.239 --> 34:18.960
Living here taught me

34:20.880 --> 34:22.600
who truly cares for me

34:23.920 --> 34:25.159
and who's just using me.

34:27.000 --> 34:28.120
I've learned real friendship

34:30.360 --> 34:31.639
from fake companionship.

34:32.280 --> 34:32.920
Speaking of friends,

34:34.239 --> 34:35.639
I heard that cousin of yours

34:36.719 --> 34:38.120
is even worse than those

34:38.120 --> 34:38.760
two so-called friends of yours.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.679
Dropped out, running with the streets.

34:42.199 --> 34:43.520
Xing Wu's nothing like that.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.400
Don't judge someone

34:45.400 --> 34:46.360
based on rumors.

34:48.320 --> 34:48.920
I've learned

34:48.920 --> 34:50.000
one crucial lesson lately.

34:51.239 --> 34:52.320
Never lower your standards to fit others.

34:52.440 --> 34:53.520
Your so-called friends

34:54.520 --> 34:55.719
all vanished

34:55.719 --> 34:56.800
the second trouble hit you.

34:57.800 --> 34:59.000
You have no idea

34:59.000 --> 35:00.640
what I've gone through.

35:01.120 --> 35:02.440
When I was at my lowest,

35:03.000 --> 35:04.240
it was the people of Zhazhating

35:04.240 --> 35:05.640
who lent me a hand

35:06.000 --> 35:07.200
and guided me.

35:07.400 --> 35:07.960
Enough of this.

35:08.920 --> 35:09.960
I don't want to argue with you anymore.

35:12.240 --> 35:13.680
We're going back to Beijing,

35:13.880 --> 35:14.520
no arguments.

35:15.360 --> 35:15.920
Pack your things,

35:16.560 --> 35:17.320
you're leaving with me tomorrow.

35:18.320 --> 35:19.520
You make decisions for me

35:19.520 --> 35:20.680
without asking what I want?

35:22.040 --> 35:22.640
Ye.

35:23.080 --> 35:24.280
As soon as Mr. Qing got free,

35:24.280 --> 35:25.520
he booked everything

35:25.520 --> 35:26.400
and rushed straight here,

35:26.760 --> 35:28.120
all because

35:28.200 --> 35:29.120
he misses you

35:29.200 --> 35:30.520
and wants you home.

35:31.200 --> 35:31.760
Misses me?

35:31.800 --> 35:33.320
So he's just forcing

35:33.320 --> 35:34.520
his plans on me?

35:34.880 --> 35:36.000
You decided I'd come,

35:36.000 --> 35:37.080
now you decide I'll leave.

35:37.280 --> 35:38.840
Have you ever considered my feelings?

35:40.920 --> 35:41.640
I respect your feelings,

35:41.640 --> 35:42.680
that's why I didn't

35:43.200 --> 35:44.240
drag you away today.

35:45.880 --> 35:46.440
You've got time

35:46.440 --> 35:47.400
to say goodbye to your friends.

35:51.200 --> 35:52.560
How thoughtful of you.

35:53.160 --> 35:54.520
What if I still refuse to go?

35:54.560 --> 35:55.520
You don't have a choice.

35:56.680 --> 35:57.920
Your attitude right now

35:58.280 --> 35:59.520
is exactly why

35:59.520 --> 36:00.520
you can't stay here.

36:02.400 --> 36:03.560
Your mom and I poured so much

36:03.560 --> 36:04.000
into raising you,

36:04.440 --> 36:05.280
I won't watch you ruin yourself

36:05.280 --> 36:06.640
in a place like this.

36:06.960 --> 36:07.960
Don't bring Mom into this.

36:14.520 --> 36:14.960
Fine.

36:17.520 --> 36:18.120
Since we can't

36:18.920 --> 36:19.680
reach an agreement,

36:19.680 --> 36:20.840
no more wasted words.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.360
I'll pick you up at seven tomorrow morning.

36:24.600 --> 36:25.000
Let's go, Sun Hai.

37:14.160 --> 37:14.800
It worked.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.360
Right, Grandma?

37:16.360 --> 37:16.840
Look good?

37:16.840 --> 37:17.400
Absolutely perfect.

37:17.400 --> 37:20.360
Good state, good state, good state.

37:46.080 --> 37:47.920
It's actually pretty good.

37:48.120 --> 37:48.760
Yeah?

37:48.920 --> 37:50.120
Told you it'd be good.

37:50.360 --> 37:52.640
Get another bowl for Ye.

38:16.680 --> 38:17.200
Hey,

38:17.880 --> 38:18.520
what exactly did you put

38:18.520 --> 38:20.120
inside this?

38:20.720 --> 38:22.520
It's so heavy!

38:24.520 --> 38:25.200
What's this strong smell?

38:25.200 --> 38:26.320
Why is it so pungent?

38:26.720 --> 38:27.760
You've never used mosquito coil?

38:29.920 --> 38:30.800
Friendly reminder.

38:31.680 --> 38:32.400
These local mosquitoes

38:32.920 --> 38:34.000
could drain a whole pig dry.

38:34.320 --> 38:35.160
How many bites have you got?

38:35.520 --> 38:36.160
Who are you calling a pig?

38:37.120 --> 38:38.360
Installing an AC for me?

38:39.120 --> 38:40.200
Second-hand unit from the shop,

38:40.400 --> 38:40.920
make do for now.

38:42.440 --> 38:44.000
This isn't just a used AC.

38:44.320 --> 38:46.440
This is a leap in quality of life.

38:52.120 --> 38:52.520
This one,

38:53.440 --> 38:54.200
the smallest thinnest tile

38:54.720 --> 38:55.240
is Chick.

38:56.080 --> 38:56.720
Blankie here,

38:57.280 --> 38:58.000
and that's Fortune.

38:59.360 --> 39:00.120
Don't tell me

39:00.320 --> 39:01.160
it was you who

39:01.160 --> 39:02.120
got my computer back for me.

39:02.520 --> 39:03.200
You can say it was me,

39:04.080 --> 39:04.760
if you want.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.240
What, gonna

39:07.120 --> 39:08.120
kowtow three times to thank me?

39:21.440 --> 39:21.880
Look.

39:22.520 --> 39:23.280
Even paper planes

39:23.760 --> 39:25.120
can change how they fly.

39:26.520 --> 39:28.160
You really don't wanna change your mind?

39:38.840 --> 39:40.280
Look good?

39:40.840 --> 39:42.160
Stunning.

39:42.560 --> 39:42.880
Yeah?

39:42.880 --> 39:44.000
I think you're even more beautiful

39:44.000 --> 39:46.080
than the models on TV.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.200
I mean it.

40:04.600 --> 40:05.120
Ye.

40:05.720 --> 40:06.200
Mr. Sun.

40:06.280 --> 40:06.800
Your dad bought

40:06.800 --> 40:07.840
this down jacket for you.

40:08.280 --> 40:09.360
It's freezing out, put it on.

40:16.880 --> 40:17.920
Forgive me for speaking my mind.

40:19.120 --> 40:20.360
I have kids too.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.320
No parent wants to see their kid

40:22.560 --> 40:23.120
without

40:23.120 --> 40:24.160
a proper warm coat

40:24.160 --> 40:24.760
in winter.

40:25.360 --> 40:25.960
I understand

40:26.400 --> 40:27.840
how your dad feels.

40:29.560 --> 40:30.160
Mr. Sun.

40:30.880 --> 40:32.080
No need to persuade me on his behalf.

40:33.720 --> 40:35.000
I've watched you grow up,

40:35.680 --> 40:37.000
and I'll be frank with you.

40:37.720 --> 40:38.440
I can tell

40:38.800 --> 40:40.000
your aunt's family

40:40.240 --> 40:41.360
treats you sincerely.

40:41.840 --> 40:42.640
You've grown

40:42.960 --> 40:44.360
attached to them after all this time.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.200
I understand

40:46.520 --> 40:47.720
you hate to

40:47.840 --> 40:48.360
abandon them

40:48.680 --> 40:50.000
when they're struggling most.

40:51.800 --> 40:52.440
But Ye,

40:53.120 --> 40:53.600
think about it,

40:54.720 --> 40:55.520
their whole family's

40:56.000 --> 40:57.240
barely hanging on,

40:57.680 --> 40:59.200
like a leaky boat

40:59.440 --> 41:00.760
with four people

41:01.000 --> 41:02.360
bailing nonstop.

41:02.920 --> 41:04.080
The boat will sink eventually.

41:04.360 --> 41:05.640
If one person steps off early,

41:06.720 --> 41:08.440
the rest get to breathe easier.

41:10.960 --> 41:12.400
A single bun split four ways

41:12.520 --> 41:13.360
leaves everyone hungry.

41:13.920 --> 41:15.000
Leaving now isn't

41:15.400 --> 41:16.400
just for your dad,

41:17.240 --> 41:18.160
it eases their burden too.

41:28.360 --> 41:29.240
Ye, you're back.

41:30.920 --> 41:32.520
Why are you alone?

41:32.840 --> 41:33.560
Where's your father?

41:36.520 --> 41:37.200
What's wrong?

41:38.680 --> 41:39.800
Did you two fight?

41:40.960 --> 41:41.560
Auntie,

41:42.520 --> 41:43.440
Dad's taking me home.

41:51.960 --> 41:52.680
I figured.

41:53.000 --> 41:54.040
That makes sense.

41:54.440 --> 41:55.280
It's good news.

41:57.280 --> 41:58.640
Did he say when you're leaving?

41:58.880 --> 42:00.080
If it's not urgent, how about

42:00.080 --> 42:02.520
leaving after Lantern Festival tomorrow?

42:02.800 --> 42:03.600
Show him

42:03.600 --> 42:04.360
around the island

42:04.800 --> 42:06.000
for a couple

42:06.000 --> 42:07.200
extra days.

42:07.920 --> 42:10.000
Stay as many days as you can.

42:10.840 --> 42:11.840
Leaving tomorrow morning.

42:33.960 --> 42:34.520
Wu.

42:35.360 --> 42:36.520
Qing Ye's father is taking her away.

42:37.120 --> 42:37.880
Tomorrow morning.

42:47.440 --> 42:48.000
Xing Wu.

42:48.560 --> 42:49.160
Xing Wu.

42:49.680 --> 42:50.600
Someone's here for you.

42:52.520 --> 42:53.000
Ms. Wang.

42:53.200 --> 42:53.920
Could you finish this for me?

42:54.160 --> 42:54.680
Yeah.

43:22.400 --> 43:23.440
You must be Xing Wu.

43:25.160 --> 43:26.360
I'm Ye's father.

43:27.440 --> 43:28.800
I'm taking Ye home tomorrow.

43:31.760 --> 43:32.400
I know.

43:34.320 --> 43:35.960
I came to

43:36.000 --> 43:37.000
ask a favor of you.

43:38.200 --> 43:38.800
Go ahead, sir.
